      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "168627+NeoTech@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-26T20:57:05Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(pathkernel): the medial line, trace and helix guide planners\n\nSub-PR 2 of 2 of K2 (#4176) on side/path-kernel:\n- MedialPlanner: the medial axis of the cutter-centre area (new\n  Region::medial_axis in camcraft-geometry: Voronoi of the sampled\n  boundary via a Bowyer-Watson Delaunay, theta-pruned, RDP-simplified).\n- TracePlanner on a new KernelRegion::Chains (chain_region): the chains\n  at a left/right/zero offset (new geo2d::offset_side for open chains),\n  the keep-out stretches left out and named.\n- Exact circle rings of a hole (RingsChoice with a circle) and\n  HelixPlanner (GuideChoice::Helix, Curve::helix with its Lead).\n- Guides plans every family; FAMILY_NOT_YET and CIRCLE_NOT_YET are gone.\n\nPinned by the laws suite (guide_medial, guide_trace, guide_helix,\nguide_laws: L1-L4) and the motion pins kernel_guides against the #4153\ngoldens. Decisions: docs/decisions/4176-kernel-guides-medial-trace-helix.md.\n\nRefs #4176\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
