      "message": "test(pathkernel): pin the downstream refusal of the trace chain region\n\nReview of PR #4244: each later stage on the side branch that reads the\nregion (the entry stage's entry and exit, the law kit's planar read and\nrun) refuses the chain region of a trace by its named reason, never with\na panic or a plan. Follow-up #4236 makes these stages accept it.\n\nRefs #4176\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
