        "date": "2026-11-27T00:22:56Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge side/path-kernel (K4, PR #4234) into the K2b guide branch\n\nConflicts resolved by keeping both sides:\n- crates/geometry/src/geo2d.rs: the medial, side-offset and segment\n  re-exports.\n- crates/pathkernel/src/guide.rs: K4's Curve::turn_of keeps the lead\n  check of the helix (a match needs the same lead).\n- crates/pathkernel/tests/laws.rs: the Gate map lists both sides' modules.\nAlso: order::ORDER_NOT_PLANAR is re-exported, and the downstream table\ntest now covers K4's OrderStage (refused) and LinkStage (a named lift).\n\nRefs #4176\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
